test-results/

# Claude Code project configuration is kept local rather than shared -- except the rules,
# which are not local to anybody. `.claude/CLAUDE.md` holds the workflow every change goes
# through and the rule that tests ship with behaviour, and excluding it meant a fresh clone
# got the root template and no rules at all.
#
# Everything else here stays out: `settings.local.json` is one machine's, and `worktrees/`
# is working state.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
